    "responseInput": "BOSS DS-1 Output -> Audio In 1 (L)",
    "notes": "Shielded 1/4 inch TS instrument cables. 9V DC isolated center-negative power.",
    "steps": [
      "Connect Audio Interface Out 1 (L) to DS-1 INPUT jack with a 1/4\" TS cable.",
      "Connect DS-1 OUTPUT jack to Audio Interface In 1 (L) with a 1/4\" TS cable.",
      "Connect 9V DC power supply (or ensure a fresh 9V battery is installed).",
      "Step on the footswitch and verify the CHECK LED illuminates red.",
      "Set TONE to 12 o'clock, LEVEL to 12 o'clock, and DIST to 9 o'clock."
